      * RPG III file description continuation records (RV-32)
     H
      * COMIT on the main line; RECNO, INFDS, INFSR on continuation records
     FCUSTMAS IF  E           K        DISK         KCOMIT
     FORDERS  UF  E           K        DISK
     F                                              KRECNO RRN
     F                                              KINFDS ORDDS
     F                                              KINFSR *PSSR
      * RENAME and IGNORE of record formats
     FITEMS   IF  E           K        DISK
     F            ITEMREC                           KRENAMEITEMR
     F            OLDREC                            KIGNORE
      * Printer file with a file exception/error subroutine
     FQPRINT  O   F     132            PRINTER
     F                                              KINFSR PRTERR
      * Not converted
     FLATE    IF  E           K        DISK
     F                                              KNUM   1
     FLATE2   IF  E           K        DISK
     F                                              KRECNO RRN1
     F                                              KRECNO RRN2
     FLATE3   IF  E           K        DISK
     F                                              KXYZ   A
     FLATE4   IF  E           K        DISK
     F                                              KCOMIT A
     FREPORT  O   F      80            PRINTER
     F                                              KPRTCTLPRTDS
     FLATE5   IF  F      80            DISK
     F            FMT1                              KRENAMEFMT2
     FLATE6   IF  E           K        DISK
     F                                              KINFDS 1BAD
